# Snow White! 🍎

This emoji sequence tells the story of **Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs**, the classic Brothers Grimm fairy tale (and the famous 1937 Disney animated film).

Here's the breakdown:

- 👸🏡👨‍👩‍👧‍👦👑😠 — A princess lives with a family, but a king/queen is angry (Snow White's jealous stepmother, the Evil Queen)
- 👸🪞✨👸🏻👑 — The Queen asks her Magic Mirror "who is the fairest of them all"
- 👸🏻👿🍎⚰️ — The jealous Queen poisons an apple, putting Snow White into a death-like sleep
- 🐻🐿️🐦👸😴 — Snow White sleeps in the forest, surrounded by animals (and presumably the seven dwarfs)
- 🤴😘💍👸💖 — Prince Charming's kiss awakens her, and they live happily ever after

It's one of the most iconic fairy tales in popular culture — the "poisoned apple," "magic mirror," and "true love's kiss" tropes all originate from or were popularized by this story. It was also Disney's first full-length animated feature film! 🎬✨ [end of text]


